></label><input id="projectProfileTheme" value="${esc(p.theme||'default')}"><div class="field-help">Leave <code>default</code> unless a specific theme package tells you to choose another preset.</div></div></details><div class="buttons"><button class="save" id="saveProjectProfile">Save Project Identity</button><a class="nav" style="text-decoration:none" href="../home/?manage=${encodeURIComponent(p.slug||'')}">Manage on LOOM Home</a></div><div id="projectProfileMsg" class="msg"></div></div><div><div class="project-profile-logo">${logo}</div><div class="field"><label>Project logo.png</label><input id="projectLogoFile" type="file" accept="image/*"></div><div class="buttons"><button class="secondary" id="uploadProjectLogo">Upload / Replace logo.png</button></div><div class="msg">Your logo image and your canonical text wordmark are separate brand assets. Either location can show the logo, text, both, or neither depending on that module's controls.</div></div></div>`;
